7. Precautions

1. Check the IC pin configurations before making connections.
2. Switch off the power supply before changing connections.
3. Ensure proper clock and input connections.
4. Avoid the forbidden input condition in the RS flip-flop.
5. Observe the outputs carefully after each clock pulse.

8. Observation

The outputs of RS, D, JK and T flip-flops were observed for different input combinations and clock pulses.

9. Result

The truth tables of RS, JK, T and D flip-flops were verified using NAND and NOR gates.
